":"1","lemma":"도로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도로가","audio":"/audio/93b8cb484c222c0b7507.mp3"}},{"text":"온통","meaning":"全，完全","explanation":"온통：全，完全。","readings":[{"term":"온통","audio":"/audio/f38a1478e95c1ffb6cd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67840","senseId":"1","lemma":"온통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온통","audio":"/audio/f38a1478e95c1ffb6cd5.mp3"}},{"text":"피투성이일","meaning":"浑身是血，血肉模糊","explanation":"피투성이：浑身是血，血肉模糊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"피투성이","audio":"/audio/5eb20c372e7780aec380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85540","senseId":"1","lemma":"피투성이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피투성이일","audio":"/audio/fbe0b5e667e43e822657.mp3"}},{"text":"정도로","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도로","audio":"/audio/ec305014b1a4cd03a44c.mp3"}},{"text":"현장은","meaning":"现场","explanation":"현장：现场；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"현장","audio":"/audio/90d78fc6fd542ae24196.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86877","senseId":"2","lemma":"현장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"현장은","audio":"/audio/12eb72cc03e2dbb0edd4.mp3"}},{"text":"비참합니다.","meaning":"悲惨","explanation":"비참하다：悲惨；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"비참하다","audio":"/audio/398642053e3de528ac99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60793","senseId":"1","lemma":"비참하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비참합니다","audio":"/audio/b154b65a8b83130bdf05.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"60982a61e50d3bea","term":"도로","zh":"道路，公路","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3","entryId":"47886","definition":"供人或车通行而建造的路。","pronunciation":["도ː로"]},{"id":"f38a1478e95c1ffb","term":"온통","zh":"全，完全","audio":"/audio/f38